# 2026-08-15 02:30:09.168222
+Fix two confirmed live-test defects only.
+
+1. Local-generation timeout: MusicGen-small on this M1 takes approximately 40–90 seconds for a 5-second generation. The current frontend gives up at about 60 seconds even though the backend subsequently completes successfully. Increase the client wait ceiling to 300 seconds while preserving the existing polling approach. A long-running generating backend status must not be treated as a failure before that ceiling.
+
+2. Prompt/error state isolation: A timeout/error message has been observed becoming the next generation request's prompt. Error/status text must never modify or replace the prompt input state. Preserve the user's prompt unchanged on success, timeout, or failure.
+
+Do not change the generator backend, persistence architecture, Stage 0 behavior, eligibility rules, or UI structure.
+
+Also inspect whether the seed submitted by MUSIC actually reaches the backend request unchanged. Do not change seed behavior yet; report what you find.
+
+Add/update targeted tests, then run those tests and npm run build.

